                                    <h2><span class="shaft"><img src="//cdn.recordinghacks.com/images/icons/patterns/icon_9.png" id="1844-0" width=27 height=27 alt="9 polar patterns" title="Cardioid, Omni, Figure 8, and six intermediate positions" ></span>ADK Z-12</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    Multi-Pattern Tube Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Z-12 is ADK&#8217;s modern take on the famous and rare C-12, a mic known for its brilliance and clarity. The company says this is their most mid-boosted and detailed microphone in the Z MOD range, with a boost around 5kHz (contrast this with the 15kHz boost of the Z-251). The focused and detailed midrange is intended to bring vocals to the front in a dense mix and shines in rock, pop and hip-hop applications, as well as in use on fretted instruments and as overheads, especially in a darker recording space. </p><p>The Z-12 utilizes an English Sowter transformer, although ADK offers to custom build this mic with alternative transformers from Lundahl, Lehle, or Jensen.</p><p>The Z-12 is finished in a &#8220;ruby red&#8221; powder coat. </p><p>A variety of tubes is included with the Z-12, allowing users to further refine the sound, distortion characteristics and vibe for the project at hand.</p><p>Each Z MOD microphone ships with the following:</p><ul><li>American-made tweed flight case</li><br /><li>American chrome and powder-coat chassis</li><br /><li>Hand-crafted in USA electronics assembly</li><br /><li>American hardwood velvet-lined microphone case</li><br /><li>Heavy-duty ring-shock combination suspension mount</li><br /><li>Heavy-duty low-profile ring mount (hard-mount)</li><br /><li>Metal pop-filter (with goose-neck and clamp)</li><br /><li>Switchable 115/230v power supply with 9 polar patterns</li><br /><li>16-foot USA made Accusound Silver-Pro 7-pin tube microphone XLR Cable</li><br /><li>16-foot USA made Accusound Silver-Pro 3-pin microphone XLR cable</li><br /><li>Spare elastics for shock mount</li><br /><li>Extra low-noise valve/tube sampler pack for fine-tuning mic characteristics</li></ul><p><p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/ADK/z-12">ADK z-12</a></p>
